        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Hi, I'm Nickie! 👋</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.7;">I'm a mom of five beautiful kids, including a set of twins, a former speech-language pathologist (still licensed and certified...just on the back burner), and the founder of Wellness Savings. After spending over a decade working with children and families in pediatric therapy, I stepped back from my clinical career to focus on raising my growing family. Since then, I've been extremely passionate about wellness and nutrition and have spent countless hours researching and studying these topics, so the recommendations on this site are informed, not just trendy.</p>
        <p style="font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.7;">None of this happens without my fiancé, Jared. He's amazing; he supports our family and my mission to help other parents find honest wellness without paying full price. He's also an incredible dad, my best friend, and biggest supporter through everything. I'm so grateful for him.</p>
